      "writtenOn": "2021-07-05T05:06:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC Lorenzo\u0027s comment it would not be meant to prevent the crash, just to prevent the WTF.\nI would not favor doing this though, since in spirit nri.mRequests is immutable for a given NRI. We never add or remove requests once the NRI is created ; in a sense you could imagine passing a ref to a released NRI to some logging function and still expect to see what NRs it used to contain.",
      "parentUuid": "953b9408_d84c236f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 4240,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 4240,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "ac5b3139d5304bc83e71fe9e6b579605ac57e294",
